== r02_tuplereturn
  san:    exit 0 run: a Qbc1 b ab|baked: a Qbc1 b ab|
  O3:     exit 0 run: a Qbc1 b ab|baked: a Qbc1 b ab|
  interp: exit 0 run: a Qbc1 b ab|baked: a Qbc1 b ab|
--- compile (-debug -sanitize)
built ./build/r02_tuplereturn.debug.san
--- run san
run: a Qbc1 b ab
